A limited edition coin inspired by ''Skyrim''. Only 9,995 of these coins were minted.<!-- The coin is corrosion resistant due to being made from zinc alloy.-->

The head of the coin has the Dragonborn warrior embossed in the center, and Esbern's dialogue from the trailer on the border. ("But... there is one they fear. In their tongue... He is 'Dovahkiin' Dragonborn!") On the tail-side of the coin: Skyrim's logo is embossed in the center, and ornate knotwork adorns the border. The individual coin's mint number is printed on the bottom-right.
